  {"description": "Generated once at channel entry and propagated across Frappe logs, dispatch, runtime logs, tool calls and result documents. Deliberately not unique: one operation can span several runs, and a workflow's node runs all share their parent's ID. Uniqueness lives on the idempotency key.", "fieldname": "correlation_id", "fieldtype": "Data", "in_standard_filter": 1, "label": "Correlation ID", "reqd": 1, "search_index": 1},
